WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:10.920
Deadline

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.790
Look, Ypsilon is quite calm now.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:27.420
We're close to realizing our dream
of a humanoid war machine.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:32.330
Yes. It appears his feelings toward
Proto One have turned to hatred.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.500
A little more...

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.920
Ypsilon, withdraw! The Balarant are attacking!

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.500
The Balarant!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.790
You can't fight him now!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.330
Everyone, get your helmets on!

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.040
Helmet! Helmet!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.130
Hey! Don't move!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.580
Cut it out! You're gonna die, too, you idiot!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.000
Here!

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:04.460
Dammit, why'd the Balarant
have to show up now?!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.920
No kidding! Thanks to you,
our only defense is out there!

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.500
If you've got complaints, I'll take you on!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:13.710
I'll never forgive those Red Shoulder bastards
for turning my world upside-down!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.040
Fyana, let's get out of here!

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:18.920
Gotcha!

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:26.790
Ypsilon! Ypsilon!
Open an escape route to point 1-0-2!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.420
We'll rendezvous there!

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:31.080
Repeat, open an escape route to point 1-0-2!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.790
We'll rendezvous there!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.000
What are you doing?!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.750
Take us into the shadow of
the wreckage, full speed!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.960
We should be able to hide in there!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.420
You're running away, Red Shoulder?!

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:55.420
Zophie! C'mon, we have to get out of here!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:14.460
Move it!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.880
Get to the ship!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.290
C'mon!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.040
We're in trouble!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.130
Underground! We have to get underground!

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:41.330
Hurry!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.380
You're not getting away, Red Shoulder!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.830
I'm tired.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.130
Get some sleep.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:56.330
I wonder if the others are all right?

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.540
They're probably safer than we are.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.210
Okay, hang on.

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.130
Now you, Pops.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.670
All right, let's catch our breath.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:26.080
Hey, aren't you worried about Chirico at all?

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.250
Are we just abandoning him?

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.880
He's fine. That guy got away safe and sound.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.000
Besides, do you want to go back
and look for him?

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:39.540
We gotta start all over again, right?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:43.210
So let's worry about saving
ourselves first and then Chirico.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:45.580
Down!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:46.540
What?

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.290
Just practicing what you preach. Look!

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.080
I'll get you. I won't let you go!

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.830
Our soldiers are searching the area right now,

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:46.040
but no one's found anything like
a PS among the bodies.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.040
Have you identified them?

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:53.960
Most are the scrap dealers, but there's another
group mixed in among them we can't ID.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.460
We're also in pursuit of the people
who escaped from the base.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.380
If you receive any more information,
report at once!

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:01.210
Sir!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.710
Where are we going?

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.500
I'm not alone anymore.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.630
What?

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.790
No, nothing.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.580
Just relax and get some sleep.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.580
Chirico, what's that?

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:06.000
A military map.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:10.920
Balarant?!

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.250
No, they wouldn't hide.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.250
Fyana, take that body and run up there with it!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.250
Hurry!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.380
All right.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.380
I should've known.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:08.750
You destroyed everything I had.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:12.080
You killed my husband and children.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.080
You and your Red Shoulder friends.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.920
So, what are you gonna do?

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.500
Killing comes naturally to you.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:21.170
What's the matter?
Why don't you send me to my family?!

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.880
If you're going to kill me, then do it!

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.000
Go on!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.330
That's what you live for, isn't it?!

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.330
As long as I'm still alive, I'll come after you.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:35.250
And someday I'm going to kill you!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.880
Why don't you say something?!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.000
You love killing people, don't you?!

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.500
If you want so badly for me to kill you,
I'll be happy to oblige.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.420
Chirico!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.380
Where are you taking me?

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.580
To your graveyard.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.420
Chirico! Are you serious?!

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:14.880
Stop.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.830
We've driven forty miles.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.710
Now walk back to your own truck.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.670
We're going on alone.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.670
I guess this is goodbye.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:37.750
Let's go.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.830
Murderer!

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.580
Remember this: I'll come after you!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.330
Can you eat?

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:33.830
When I became a Red Shoulder,
they trained us to eat whatever was in the area.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:35.960
Are you still cold?

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.130
It's... It's not that.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:41.040
I can't... stop shaking...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.710
Hold me, please!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.540
Please! Hurry!

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:51.040
All right...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.710
Hold me tighter...

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.210
Just hold me for a while...

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:29.880
Wait a minute...

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:32.580
Fyana, do you need jijirium?!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.540
This is part of being a PS.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:40.170
As the jijirium's effect wears off,
my body starts to stiffen up.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.040
Why didn't you tell me before?!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.960
What's the point?

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.670
There's no jijirium around here.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.540
Don't speak too soon.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.960
There's some sort of supply base here.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.830
I was thinking of going out and seeing what's there.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.250
A supply base...?

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.920
It looks like an unmanned station
the Balarant set up secretly.

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:03.920
When the cease-fire zone was made,
they may have left the supplies.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:07.290
There may be liquid jijirium there.
We'd better go now.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.830
Can you hang on a little longer?

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.750
Yes, I'm fine. Don't worry.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.420
The Balarant?!

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.790
Get your helmet on!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.920
This is tracker team!

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:00.040
We've found some of their accomplices!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.380
Now attacking them.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.500
Looks like that tip we got was for real.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:18.250
Are you okay?

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:20.170
Yeah... It's nothing.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.500
You Red Shoulder monster!

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.580
Fyana, can you get into your AT?

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.920
Yes, I can!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:29.830
Shit...

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.250
You're not getting away!

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:39.920
Move it!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:03.000
Chirico!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.290
This is tracker team!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:36.250
Our seven pursuing ATs have been destroyed.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.670
We have to pull back!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.330
How do I help you?

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:11.170
Isn't there some way?!

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:15.000
Impossible. My body's starting to freeze up.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.710
Soon I won't be able to move at all.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:21.210
Stop talking like that! I'll figure out something!

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.000
Die, you butcher!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.670
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.040
Come out and face me, butcher!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.330
Where are you?!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.670
This time you'll die!

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:18.330
You'll know the pain my husband and sons felt!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.040
Fyana!

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.500
Shoot if you're going to!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.670
I was the one who sold you out to the Balarant!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.880
Shooting women isn't my style.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:05.380
Fyana!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.710
I can't move anymore.

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.540
Look at my arm...

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.500
This is taking all my strength.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.960
I have a favor to ask, Chirico.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:24.210
Leave me. Leave me behind.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.250
I'm so tired...!

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.080
Don't joke around like that.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.880
You know I take everything seriously.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:42.080
I told you to leave everything to me, didn't I?

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:08.290
But, is that unmanned station still there?

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:12.580
And if it is, is there any jijirium?

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:15.750
And even if there is, will she make it there?

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:27.000
I don't need anyone else.

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:31.630
I don't want to lose you now!

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:42.750
You won't get away!

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:44.670
No matter what it takes...

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:47.580
I'm going to kill you!

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:59.880
Family. Desires. Laughter. Tears.

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:03.000
Once, many people breathed on this world.

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:06.750
But, one day, fire burnt them
to a handful of sand.

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:10.420
The sand covered everything,
turning the world to desert.

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:13.170
Now, the storms seen here are sand storms.

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:17.380
This world of anger and sadness
is reflected in its violent atmosphere.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.750
Next time, "Love and Hate"

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.500
The blowing sand grains strike at the heart.

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:24.290
Love and Hate

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
